Looking! I'll blitz loop this planet to search way.

344
00:39:54,046 --> 00:39:56,546
Only my RAILGUN can shoot it. 今すぐ
Only my railgun can shoot it, right now!

345
00:39:56,546 --> 00:39:59,546
身体中を 光の速さで
Running through my body at the speed of light...

346
00:40:00,282 --> 00:40:01,882
光の速さで
...at the speed of light,

347
00:40:01,882 --> 00:40:05,482
駆け巡った 確かな予感
a certain premonition ran through.

348
00:40:05,482 --> 00:40:11,882
掴め! 望むものなら残さず 輝ける自分らしさで
Seize it! If it's your wish, leave nothing behind with your shining self!

349
00:40:12,182 --> 00:40:14,982
信じてるよ あの日の誓いを
I believe in the vow made that day,

350
00:40:15,082 --> 00:40:23,082
この瞳に光る涙 それさえも強さになるから
for even the tears glittering in these eyes will become my strength!

351
00:40:26,582 --> 00:40:32,482
立ち止まると 少しだけ 感じる切なさに
When I stop, for just a moment, in the sadness I feel...

352
00:40:32,482 --> 00:40:39,182
戸惑う事 無いなんて 嘘はつかないよ
I won't lie and say I never hesitate.

353
00:40:39,282 --> 00:40:46,082
宇宙に舞うコインが描く 放物線が決める運命
The parabola drawn by a coin dancing in the sky decides our fate.

354
00:40:46,082 --> 00:40:52,582
打ち出した答えが今日も 私の胸を駆け巡る
The answer shot forth still runs through my heart today.

355
00:40:54,082 --> 00:40:57,082
Sparkling! The shiny lights awake true desire.
Sparkling! The shiny lights awaken true desire.

356
00:40:57,082 --> 00:41:00,682
Only my RAILGUN can shoot it. 必ず
Only my RAILGUN can shoot it, without fail,

357
00:41:00,782 --> 00:41:03,982
貫いてく 途惑うことなく
piercing through without hesitation.

358
00:41:03,982 --> 00:41:07,182
傷ついても 走り続ける
Even if I get hurt, I'll keep running.

359
00:41:07,282 --> 00:41:13,982
狙え! 凛と煌めく視線は 狂い無く闇を切り裂く
Aim! That dignified, glittering gaze tears through the darkness unerringly.

360
00:41:14,082 --> 00:41:17,382
迷いなんて 吹き飛ばせばいい
Just blow away any doubts!

361
00:41:17,382 --> 00:41:25,082
この心が叫ぶ限り 誰ひとり邪魔などさせない
As long as my heart screams, I won't let anyone get in my way!

362
00:41:54,282 --> 00:41:57,582
儚く舞う 無数の願いは
The countless wishes that dance transiently

363
00:41:57,582 --> 00:42:00,882
この両手に 積もってゆく
will gather in these hands.

364
00:42:00,982 --> 00:42:04,382
切り裂く闇に 見えてくるのは
What I see in the tearing darkness

365
00:42:04,382 --> 00:42:07,882
重く深く 切ない記憶
is a heavy, deep, painful memory.

366
00:42:07,882 --> 00:42:11,282
色褪せてく 現実に揺れる
Swaying in a fading reality,

367
00:42:11,282 --> 00:42:14,582
絶望には 負けたくない
I don't want to lose to despair.

368
00:42:14,582 --> 00:42:18,082
私が今 私であること
That I am myself right now,

369
00:42:18,082 --> 00:42:21,082
胸を張って 全て誇れる!
I'll hold my head high and be proud of it all!

370
00:42:21,182 --> 00:42:24,482
Looking! The blitz loop this planet to search way.
Looking! The blitz loop this planet to search a way.

371
00:42:24,482 --> 00:42:28,082
Only my RAILGUN can shoot it. 今すぐ
Only my RAILGUN can shoot it, right now!

372
00:42:28,082 --> 00:42:31,082
身体中を 光の速さで
Running through my entire body at the speed of light,

373
00:42:31,082 --> 00:42:34,582
駆け巡った 確かな予感
is a certain premonition.

374
00:42:34,582 --> 00:42:41,382
放て! 心に刻んだ夢を 未来さえ置き去りにして
Release it! Leaving behind even the future and the dreams engraved in your heart!

375
00:42:41,382 --> 00:42:44,882
限界など知らない 意味無い!
I know no limits, they're meaningless!

376
00:42:44,882 --> 00:42:53,582
この能力が光散らす その先に遥かな想いを
This power will scatter light toward those distant feelings!

377
00:43:48,082 --> 00:43:52,082
青のすみか
作詞・作曲：キタニタツヤ
Where Our Blue Is
Lyrics & Composition: Tatsuya Kitani

378
00:43:53,282 --> 00:43:59,082
どこまでも続くような青の季節は
The blue season that seems to stretch on forever...

379
00:43:59,482 --> 00:44:06,182
四つ並ぶ眼の前を遮るものは何もない
...has nothing blocking the four eyes lined up in front.

380
00:44:06,282 --> 00:44:11,282
アスファルト、蝉時雨を反射して
Reflecting off the asphalt, the shower of cicada cries...

381
00:44:11,382 --> 00:44:17,382
きみという沈黙が聞こえなくなる
...makes the silence called 'you' no longer audible.

382
00:44:17,382 --> 00:44:20,582
この日々が色褪せる
Even as these days fade away,

383
00:44:20,582 --> 00:44:24,282
僕と違うきみの匂いを知ってしまっても
and I come to know your scent, different from mine...

384
00:44:24,382 --> 00:44:31,082
置き忘れてきた永遠の底に
...at the bottom of the eternity we left behind,

385
00:44:31,182 --> 00:44:34,282
今でも青が棲んでいる
the blue still resides.

386
00:44:34,282 --> 00:44:37,582
今でも青は澄んでいる
The blue is still clear.

387
00:44:37,682 --> 00:44:40,882
どんな祈りも言葉も
No matter the prayers or the words,

388
00:44:40,882 --> 00:44:44,282
近づけるのに、届かなかった
though they got close, they never reached.

389
00:44:44,382 --> 00:44:47,582
まるで、静かな恋のような
Just like a quiet love,

390
00:44:47,582 --> 00:44:51,082
頬を伝った夏のような色の中
in a color like summer running down our cheeks,

391
00:44:51,182 --> 00:44:56,582
きみを呪う言葉がずっと 喉の奥につかえてる
the words that bind you are forever stuck in my throat...

392
00:44:56,682 --> 00:45:03,082
「また会えるよね」って 声にならない声
...a silent voice saying, "We'll meet again, right?"

393
00:45:11,070 --> 00:45:16,870
昼下がり、じめつく風の季節は
In the mid-afternoon, during the muggy wind season,

394
00:45:17,470 --> 00:45:23,270
想い馳せる、まだ何者でもなかった僕らの肖像
I think back to the portraits of us, when we were still nobody.

395
00:45:23,870 --> 00:45:28,570
何もかも分かち合えたはずだった
We should have been able to share everything,

396
00:45:28,870 --> 00:45:31,970
あの日から少しずつ
but little by little since that day,

397
00:45:32,070 --> 00:45:35,570
きみと違う僕という呪いが肥えていく
the curse of me being different from you has grown.

398
00:45:47,570 --> 00:45:53,270
きみの笑顔の奥の憂いを
The sorrow hidden behind your smile...

399
00:45:54,070 --> 00:46:00,570
見落としたこと、悔やみ尽くして
...I completely regret having overlooked it.

400
00:46:07,570 --> 00:46:12,570
徒花と咲いて散っていくきみに
To you, who bloom as a transient flower and wither...

401
00:46:12,870 --> 00:46:14,570
さよなら
Goodbye.

402
00:46:14,670 --> 00:46:18,270
今でも青が棲んでいる
Even now, the blue still resides.

403
00:46:18,470 --> 00:46:21,870
今でも青は澄んでいる
Even now, the blue remains clear.

404
00:46:21,970 --> 00:46:24,870
どんな祈りも言葉も
No matter the prayers or words,

405
00:46:25,070 --> 00:46:28,070
近づけるのに、届かなかった
they couldn't get us any closer, they couldn't reach.

406
00:46:28,170 --> 00:46:31,070
まるで、静かな恋のような
It was like a quiet love,

407
00:46:31,170 --> 00:46:34,870
頬を伝った夏のような色の中
in the midst of colors like the summer that ran down our cheeks.

408
00:46:34,970 --> 00:46:37,870
きみを呪う言葉が
The words cursing you

409
00:46:37,970 --> 00:46:40,070
ずっと喉の奥につかえてる
remain stuck in the back of my throat.

410
00:46:40,170 --> 00:46:43,270
「また会えるよね」って
"We'll meet again," you said,

411
00:46:43,370 --> 00:46:46,570
声にならない声
with a voice that couldn't be heard.

412
00:46:47,070 --> 00:46:51,470
無限に膨張する銀河の星の粒のように
Like the grains of stars in an infinitely expanding galaxy,

413
00:46:51,570 --> 00:46:54,070
指の隙間を零れた
it slipped through the gaps between my fingers.

414
00:47:31,070 --> 00:47:36,570
はい！ということでここまですね、一気にノンストップでお送りしました！
Alright! And with that, we've brought you a non-stop medley up to this point!

415
00:47:37,070 --> 00:47:41,570
いや、平成も、令和も、いや名曲ばかりでしたね！
Man, whether from the Heisei or Reiwa era, they were all truly masterpieces!

416
00:47:42,070 --> 00:47:45,070
どうでしたか？好きな曲はありましたか？
How was it? Did you hear any of your favorite songs?

417
00:47:45,570 --> 00:47:49,570
そして、みんな、どっちのチームが良かったかな？
And also, everyone, which team did you think was better?

418
00:47:52,070 --> 00:47:55,070
ほうほうほうほう...
I see, I see...

419
00:47:56,070 --> 00:48:00,570
えっとですね、この、このね、今、後ろのこのハートのステージね。
So, as you can see, this heart stage behind me...

420
00:48:01,570 --> 00:48:05,570
はい、こちらのハートに映し出された色で
Yes, based on the color displayed on this heart,

421
00:48:06,070 --> 00:48:10,070
どっちのチームが勝ったのか、決まります！
the winning team will be decided!

422
00:48:10,570 --> 00:48:15,570
ぜひ、みんなコメントで、どっちが良かったか、教えてください！
Everyone, please let me know in the comments which team you liked better!

423
00:48:16,070 --> 00:48:18,570
ええ？決められない？
What? You can't decide?

424
00:48:19,070 --> 00:48:20,570
いやいや、そこはね、ちょっとね、決めて...
No, no, you've got to choose one...

425
00:48:20,570 --> 00:48:27,070
あ、すごい、この2色にね、分かれておりますけれども、しっかり決めていただかないと、はい。
Oh, wow, the comments are split into two colors, but you really have to make a choice.

426
00:48:27,570 --> 00:48:32,570
今日はね、あの平成VS令和となっております！
Because today, it's Heisei versus Reiwa!

427
00:48:35,070 --> 00:48:39,570
はい、ということで、勝ったのは、平成赤チームか？
Alright, with that said, is the winner the Heisei Red Team?

428
00:48:40,070 --> 00:48:44,070
それとも、令和青チームか？
Or is it the Reiwa Blue Team?

429
00:48:44,570 --> 00:48:47,570
一体、どっちかな？
Which one could it be?

430
00:48:48,070 --> 00:48:53,070
それじゃあ、行くよ！さあ、結果はこちら！
Here we go! Let's see the results!

431
00:48:59,070 --> 00:49:02,070
どっちかな？
Which one is it?

432
00:49:03,570 --> 00:49:05,070
お？え？
Oh? Huh?

433
00:49:05,070 --> 00:49:07,570
なんか、紫になっちゃったんですけど！
Wait, it turned purple!

434
00:49:08,070 --> 00:49:10,570
紫って、紫ってどっちですか？
What does purple even mean? Which side is purple?

435
00:49:11,070 --> 00:49:16,570
うーん、もうこれは、あの、赤チームも良かったし、青チームも良かったということで、
Well, I guess this means both the Red Team and the Blue Team were so good...

436
00:49:17,070 --> 00:49:21,570
すべてフュージョンして、紫になってしまった！
...that they fused together and turned purple!

437
00:49:22,070 --> 00:49:25,070
ということで、いや、みんなあの、たくさん歌ったし、
So, since everyone sang their hearts out...

438
00:49:25,570 --> 00:49:30,070
ま、みんな最高だったってことにね、します！
...we'll just say that everyone was absolutely amazing!

439
00:49:31,570 --> 00:49:34,070
いや、なんか、なんか、みんなのおかげで、
Wow, somehow, thanks to all of you...

440
00:49:34,570 --> 00:49:39,570
なんか、パワーが、パワーが溜まってきた気がするなー！
I feel like... I feel like power is welling up inside me!

441
00:49:41,070 --> 00:49:43,570
お、気がするー！
I really feel it!

442
00:49:52,070 --> 00:49:56,570
ふふふっ、ということで、新衣装です！
Hehehe, and with that, here is my new outfit!

443
00:49:59,070 --> 00:50:01,070
えー、みんなのコメ...
So, let's see everyone's comm...

444
00:50:00,106 --> 00:50:05,206
なんと、全部あずきの魔力になっちゃった！
Wow, everything has turned into AZKi's magic!

445
00:50:05,906 --> 00:50:08,606
見てください、どうですか？
Take a look! What do you think?

446
00:50:09,206 --> 00:50:12,406
しっぽ、しっぽも生えてるんです保存
A tail... I even have a tail now!

447
00:50:13,106 --> 00:50:15,206
フリフリフリフリ
Wiggle, wiggle, wiggle, wiggle!

448
00:50:15,206 --> 00:50:16,906
どうですか？
How does it look?

449
00:50:17,206 --> 00:50:19,506
はい、ということで今回は
Yes! So, for this live show,

450
00:50:19,506 --> 00:50:24,106
えー、小悪魔衣装を仕立てていただきました！
I had this little devil outfit made for me!

451
00:50:24,106 --> 00:50:25,606
どうでしょうか？
What do you think?

452
00:50:25,606 --> 00:50:27,606
どうでしょうか？魔力…
What do you think? Magic power?

453
00:50:27,606 --> 00:50:31,006
魔王？ふふふ、小悪魔です
Demon King? Haha, I'm a little devil!

454
00:50:31,606 --> 00:50:33,306
はい
Yes!

455
00:50:33,306 --> 00:50:36,606
今回ですね、新衣装はこちらの小悪魔衣装！
My new outfit this time is this little devil outfit!

456
00:50:36,606 --> 00:50:38,306
可愛いでしょ？
Cute, right?

457
00:50:38,306 --> 00:50:40,606
たくさんスクリーンショットも撮ってくださいね！
Please take lots of screenshots!

458
00:50:41,106 --> 00:50:44,306
ということで、この衣装でね
So, with this outfit,

459
00:50:44,306 --> 00:50:48,606
せっかくなので、あの曲を歌っていきたいなと思います！
since we're here, I want to sing that song!

460
00:50:49,106 --> 00:50:51,606
もしかしたらね、小悪魔ですから
And you know, since I'm a little devil,

461
00:50:51,606 --> 00:50:57,706
この姿なら、魔法とかも使えちゃうんじゃないのかな？
in this form, maybe I can even use magic?

462
00:50:58,606 --> 00:51:00,106
ということで
With that said...

463
00:51:00,106 --> 00:51:01,906
ではですね
Now, then...

464
00:51:01,906 --> 00:51:05,906
次の曲、聴いてください！
Please listen to the next song!

465
00:51:13,106 --> 00:51:15,106
召喚！
Summon!

466
00:51:24,306 --> 00:51:28,906
自分の過去に囚われ迷って
Trapped and lost in my own past,

467
00:51:28,906 --> 00:51:34,106
そうじゃないよと言い聞かせて全てを
I tell myself it's not like that and...

468
00:51:34,106 --> 00:51:38,906
自由に操れるかなんて
I wonder if I can control everything freely.

469
00:51:38,906 --> 00:51:44,006
分からないよと空は霞んで正解はどこ？
"I don't know," I say, as the sky hazes over. Where is the right answer?

470
00:51:44,006 --> 00:51:48,906
僕の手のひらに残る大事なもの
The precious things remaining in my palm...

471
00:51:48,906 --> 00:51:54,106
忘れない記憶 何度でも
...are unforgettable memories, over and over again.

472
00:51:54,106 --> 00:51:59,306
君を守り抜くと叫んで
I scream that I'll protect you to the very end!

473
00:51:59,306 --> 00:52:04,306
巻き戻しの中 掴んだ愛はそう
Yes, the love I grabbed amidst rewinding time...

474
00:52:04,306 --> 00:52:06,906
離しはしないから
...is something I will never let go.

475
00:52:06,906 --> 00:52:11,906
散りばめた想い 今一度きりの願いへ
My scattered feelings now head towards a one-time wish.

476
00:52:11,906 --> 00:52:16,906
次への僕に託したよ保存
I've entrusted it to my future self.

477
00:52:16,906 --> 00:52:22,106
いつかの約束 光の道しるべになる
The promise we made will become a beacon of light.

478
00:52:22,106 --> 00:52:25,606
誓いをさあ君のため
Now, I offer this vow for your sake...

479
00:52:25,606 --> 00:52:33,306
最期まで
...until the very end!

480
00:52:33,306 --> 00:52:38,306
涙さえ力に変えてきっと描いていた望む未来へ
Changing even my tears into strength, surely towards the desired future I drew...

481
00:52:38,306 --> 00:52:41,106
繋ぐよ
...I will connect us!

482
00:52:45,606 --> 00:52:50,706
想像を超える事態に狂って
Going mad in a situation beyond my imagination,

483
00:52:50,706 --> 00:52:56,106
爪を立ててはもがき足掻いて心は
clawing, struggling, and fighting back, my heart...

484
00:52:56,106 --> 00:53:01,106
人生の過ちをもう何回
...wondering how many times I will repeat...

485
00:53:01,106 --> 00:53:05,606
繰り返しては嫌いになって泣いてても
...the mistakes of my life, growing to hate it and crying.

486
00:53:05,606 --> 00:53:11,106
君の憧れはいつも輝いてた
Yet your aspiration was always shining bright.

487
00:53:11,106 --> 00:53:13,306
I'll come back (yeah)

488
00:53:13,306 --> 00:53:16,306
To your future (go away)

489
00:53:16,306 --> 00:53:21,106
僕は抗うだろう運命に
I will fight against destiny.

490
00:53:21,406 --> 00:53:22,606
Breaking out (yeah)

491
00:53:22,606 --> 00:53:23,906
Breaking out (yeah)

492
00:53:23,906 --> 00:53:28,606
Breaking down (yeah go away)

493
00:53:28,606 --> 00:53:33,306
諦めちゃいないから
Because I haven't given up!

494
00:53:33,306 --> 00:53:38,606
結ばれた意思は 独りきりじゃない強さへ
Our bound wills head toward a strength that is no longer alone.

495
00:53:38,606 --> 00:53:43,606
紡いだ糸を手繰り寄せ
I draw in the spun threads.

496
00:53:43,606 --> 00:53:48,606
見つけた瞳は 理想を現実に変える
The eyes I found will turn ideals into reality.

497
00:53:48,606 --> 00:53:52,106
世界はそう君のため
Yes, the world is for your sake...

498
00:53:52,106 --> 00:53:59,906
最初から
...from the very beginning!

499
00:53:59,906 --> 00:54:05,306
胸に抱いた思い出とずっと あの日から続く決意で
With the memories held in my heart, and the determination continuing from that day...

500
00:54:05,306 --> 00:54:09,606
飛べるよ Redo
...I can fly! Redo!

501
00:54:10,606 --> 00:54:13,106
あずきち生誕祭、まだまだいけますか？！
AZKi-chi's Birthday Celebration! Can you still keep going?!

502
00:54:13,106 --> 00:54:16,306
盛り上がっていこう！
Let's get fired up!

503
00:54:19,906 --> 00:54:24,106
君がたとえ僕のこと
Even if you...

504
00:54:24,106 --> 00:54:29,606
忘れても
...forget about me,

505
00:54:29,606 --> 00:54:34,606
僕はもう忘れない 誰も傷つけない
I will never forget again, and I won't let anyone get hurt!

506
00:54:34,606 --> 00:54:39,606
消えそうな過去を救い出すための時間よ
Oh time, meant for rescuing a past that's about to fade away...

507
00:54:39,606 --> 00:54:47,106
ここから始まれ
...begin from right here!

508
00:54:49,606 --> 00:54:54,606
巡りゆく一瞬を 今一度きりの願いへ
This cycling moment, now towards a one-time wish.

509
00:54:54,606 --> 00:54:59,606
確かに僕は託された
Surely, it has been entrusted to me.

510
